  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Skill. You heal your animal companion for 40...104...120 Health. If your companion is dead, it is resurrected with 10...48...58% Health. If you have Comfort Animal equipped, your animal companion will travel with you.",
      "zhTW": "治療你的寵物 40～120 體力。若你的寵物已經死亡，此技能可讓牠復活並回復 10～58% 體力，裝備此技能時寵物與你同行。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Skill. You heal your animal companion for 40...104...120 Health. If your companion is dead, it is resurrected with 10...48...58% Health. If you have Comfort Animal equipped, your animal companion will travel with you.",
